\subsection{E.3 Empirical Falsification Protocol}

Following Popper, a model is validated by surviving severe tests:
\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Hypothesis Stressing:} Tests are designed to break the model.
\item \textbf{Confounder Exclusion:} Environmental and instrumental drift must be
eliminated.
\item \textbf{Data Transparency:} Raw telemetry and audit trails must be
publicly accessible.
\end{enumerate}

This protocol ensures that validation is not merely confirmatory but genuinely
falsification-resistant.

